4:["$","article",null,{"className":"prose prose-gray prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h3:text-lg prose-h3:mt-6 prose-h3:mb-3 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:mb-5 prose-li:text-gray-600 prose-ul:space-y-1 prose-a:text-blue-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"One of the most common questions businesses ask before starting a software project is: how much will this cost? The honest answer is that cost depends on scope, complexity, and what you're actually building. But that doesn't mean you have to go into a conversation with a vendor blind."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"This guide gives you a transparent breakdown of software development costs in Ghana in 2026 — across website design, custom software, SaaS platforms, mobile apps, and ERP systems — along with the key factors that influence price and how to evaluate whether a quote is fair."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Website design and development"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A business website is the most common starting point. Prices vary significantly based on what \"website\" actually means:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Simple business website (5–10 pages):"}]," $500 – $1,500"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Professional company website with SEO and contact forms:"}]," $1,500 – $4,000"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Web application or client portal:"}]," $3,000 – $10,000+"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"E-commerce website:"}]," $2,000 – $8,000 depending on product catalog and payment integration"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Be wary of very cheap website quotes (under $200). What you typically get is a template with your logo placed on it — no SEO, no performance optimization, no unique design, no ongoing support."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Custom software development"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Custom software covers anything from an internal business tool to a full operational system. Pricing depends on the number of modules, integrations, user roles, and how complex the business logic is."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Simple internal tool (e.g. invoice generator, staff scheduler):"}]," $1,500 – $4,000"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mid-size system (e.g. inventory + sales dashboard):"}]," $4,000 – $12,000"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Full-scale custom platform (multi-user, multi-branch, API integrations):"}]," $12,000 – $50,000+"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"SaaS product development"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Building a SaaS product requires more investment than a single-use internal tool because you need multi-tenancy, subscription billing, onboarding flows, and a higher standard of security and scalability."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"MVP (minimum viable product):"}]," $5,000 – $15,000"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Full-featured SaaS V1:"}]," $15,000 – $60,000+"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mobile app development"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Mobile apps (iOS and Android) built with React Native (single codebase for both platforms):"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Simple companion app (e.g. customer loyalty, booking):"}]," $3,000 – $8,000"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Feature-rich app (e.g. delivery tracking, staff app):"}]," $8,000 – $25,000"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"ERP and enterprise systems"}],"$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}]
